  "notable_quotes": [
    "Product formation is controlled mainly by metal/ligand ratio and initial pH; these two variables determine the quality and formation of the final products.",
    "Compound 1 is favored at a Zn:trz:H2suc ratio of 1:2:2, whereas no compound 1 forms at 1:1:1 under the same reaction conditions.",
    "Compound 2 exhibits a unique 3D pillared-layered framework, with Zn(II) in five-coordinate trigonal bipyramidal geometry bound to tartrate and three trz ligands."
